      "writtenOn": "2022-03-25T17:21:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this is a concrete example: http://go/paste/4509626016989184\n\nWe get an error on line 6 (where the literals are). This comes from ConstantFolder::Simplify, which takes a Left and Right expression along with an operator and the operator\u0027s Position. The Left and Right will be backwards, and the Operator\u0027s position will be on a completely different line.",
      "parentUuid": "cdd6fa93_3f468380",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 67,
